# Local backup of the Cliniko consent-form template. Contains the counsellor's
# name and a client-facing legal document — kept on disk for restore, not in git.
# qa/ holds consent-form backups and drafts. Every artifact put there so far
# has carried the counsellor's real legal name and a client-facing legal
# document, and one of them was committed by accident on 2026-08-14 and pulled
# back out before it reached the remote. Ignore the directory rather than
# naming files: the failure mode is a NEW file nobody remembered to list.
qa/

# The counsellor-name guard tokens (see scripts/expansion-verify.mjs check 8).
.name-guard
